Description: Local research and writing companion with Documancy
 Co-Writer is a local research and writing workspace with AI assistance.
 .
 Features:
  - Multi-tab editor with markdown formatting toolbar
  - File browser sidebar with workspace, notebook, and version management
  - Zettelkasten notebook with [[wikilinks]] and backlink tracking
  - LLM-powered document recovery for corrupt or unreadable files
  - AI chat with Ollama integration for editing, drafting, and rewriting
  - Import: TXT, MD, HTML, PDF, DOCX, ODT, EPUB, MOBI, RTF
  - Export: TXT, MD, HTML, PDF, DOCX, ODT
  - Dark/light theme toggle, autosave, version tracking
